MeshGraphNets CylinderFlow phase-0 stride-8 derivative

This release contains a transformed copy of the CylinderFlow dataset distributed
with the Google DeepMind MeshGraphNets research release:
https://github.com/google-deepmind/deepmind-research/tree/master/meshgraphnets

Upstream work:
Tobias Pfaff et al., "Learning Mesh-Based Simulation with Graph Networks," ICLR
2021, https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.03409.

Transformation and packaging:
- preserved the upstream 1,000 Train / 100 Validation trajectory identities;
- selected one phase-zero temporal sequence per trajectory with raw indices
  0,8,...,592;
- packed UVP, mesh coordinates, triangle cells, and node types into HDF5;
- computed the published normalization statistics from Train trajectories only.

The artifact is a temporal derivative of MeshGraphNets CylinderFlow, not an
independent simulation family. Test fields were not accessed or redistributed.
